{"change_summary":"Reviewed the latest approved validation findings for the save-schema/versioning work and made no additional code changes in this apply-fixes pass. The remaining notes were an unrelated budget-tracking regression and the pre-existing `Engine::step_hours` mutation-on-error issue, so I left the migration/save implementation as-is and reran focused validation; the save-load suite, shrimp population suite, clippy, and formatting checks passed, and the unrelated budget-tracking test still fails as previously noted.","outstanding_risks":["Known unrelated branch-level regression revalidated in this pass: `cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c -- --exact` still fails at `crates/tank_core/tests/budget_tracking.rs:629` with `expected deterministic hatching to occur in the reproducing shrimp fixture`.","Known unrelated architectural issue carried forward from prior review: `Engine::step_hours` still calls `enforce_invariants(&mut self.state)` before returning some invariant errors, so a rejected step can still mutate live state."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the latest approved review findings and rechecked the current save-schema touch points to determine whether any new actionable fixes were requested for this deliverable.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional code changes for newly requested fixes.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Reran focused validation for save-load behavior, shrimp population coverage, formatting, linting, and the previously flagged unrelated budget-tracking regression after confirming this apply-fixes pass was a no-op.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git diff --stat -- crates/tank_core/src/save.rs crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs` returned no output, confirming this apply-fixes pass did not introduce additional changes to the save-schema files.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed: 19 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population` passed: 13 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` passed with no warnings.","`cargo fmt -p tank_core -- --check` passed with no formatting issues.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c -- --exact` still fails with `expected deterministic hatching to occur in the reproducing shrimp fixture`, confirming the unrelated branch-level regression remains open."]}